        "node_id": "n_4_3ecbdd",
        "thought_text": "The error in the previous implementation was in the reconstruction of the solution. The path array was not being used correctly to determine the number of problems solved on each day. To fix this, we need to modify the reconstruction process to ensure that we're correctly tracking the number of problems solved on each day based on the dp table values. Instead of using the path array to store the split points, we should store the number of problems solved on each day directly in the dp table. This way, we can directly reconstruct the solution without needing to backtrack through the path array.",
